    iommu: qcom_iommu: Map the MSM8226 VFE stream IDs
    
    Original integration rationale and historical observations follow. These
    observations do not qualify hardware on this refreshed base.
    
    The VFE SMMU is OS-managed, so the driver programs its stream match
    registers from the configuration. Without a stream table every VFE
    transaction is an unidentified stream and faults, and captures stay
    empty. Map VFE0, VFE1 and CPP (stream IDs 0, 1 and 2) to their context
    banks, as the vendor context descriptions do.
    
    Original integration AI credit: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>.
    
    Refreshed from integration source
    05834c037143a566676c57d765e6cc4145873a3f. Current-base adaptation and
    host qualification used OpenAI Codex. Human review and new DCO
    certification remain pending.

